    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This CD-ROM contains copies of the navigation and field sidescan sonar data collected in the Gulf of Mexico during four cruises aboard the R/V FARNELLA.  The cruises, conducted during February, 1982 and August through October, 1985, were part of the USGS Exclusive Economic Zone mapping program (EEZ-SCAN) which was a cooperative program between the US Geological Survey and the Institute of Oceanographic Sciences of the UK. The survey area included the entire US Exclusive Economic Zone of the Gulf\r\nof Mexico seaward of approximately 400 m water depth (EEZ-SCAN 85, Scientific Staff, 1987; Twichell and Polloni, 1993).\"",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
